      "content": "i get that it might be a risk, but i've read so much about how vitamin c is a massive antioxidant and helps flush things out. i don't really have time for a doctor visit right now, and i feel like i can manage my own health. isn't there a way to take it where it's safe? like maybe just staying extra hydrated? i really want to try these high doses to see if it helps with the fatigue.",
